<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 34-day T-bill rate 9.05 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 34-day T-bill rate 9.05 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of Lithuanian 34-day Treasury bills was 9.05 percent on Tuesday, compared with a yield of 9.02 percent at a sale last week of 27-day paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of litas unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV YIELD   (LAST WEEK)   MIN/MAX   ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 34-day     9.05	   9.02	8.31/10.50  55   78.60  54.50</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is September 20, and the bills mature on October 24.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
